// name :
"P3032930694" "Masterpiece"
// teamrequiresfailedtext :
"P1254793078" "<color orange>All members of your team must  purchase the fourth episode of the first signature story arc, <i>Who Will Die</i>, in order to play this story arc.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DarrinWadeProposal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2837324588" "Darrin Wade's Proposal"
// DetailString :
"P302007547" "Tyrka handed you a letter from Darrin Wade, once you agreed to work together.<br><br>'Good to see you're with us. Now, you're probably wondering, what is it that you're going to get out of working with me? I hope that you don't feel as if you're my 'lackey', as you're far from it. You and I are equal in this plan; I just happened to have been planning this for a very long time.<br><br>Sister Psyche has been a thorn in everyone's side for a very long time. I'm sure you've encountered said thorn in the past. It's time to get her out of the way. Malaise has gone to great lengths to position himself near her. Now, it's up to you and I to enact the next part of the plan. Tyrka should have given you a package containing the Dirge of Chaos. She'll explain what exactly it is, if you aren't familiar with it.<br><br>I'll need to keep our meetings scarce, but after today, my hand will be revealed, and I shall be put up as one of Paragon's biggest enemies, alongside yourself, of course. You won't be alone at the top for much longer, I guarantee."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DirgeofChaos 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2644173807" "Dirge of Chaos"
// DetailString :
"P120949783" "The Dirge of Chaos is a herald of the end times, a daemon tasked with orchestrating the song that will end the world. Through endless centuries it has taken form as a variety of musical instruments, twisting the music of mortals into the strange piping anthems of things that should not be.<br><br>That's what the note in the package you opened said. The package itself contained what appeared to be a magic cassette player. Somehow this item is supposed to be the Dirge of Chaos, an item that can create chaos with whatever song is played from it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - JohnnySong 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2275382896" "Rule the World"
// DetailString :
"P3818768087" "Johnny Sonata recorded a new song entitled, 'Rule the World', on the Dirge of Chaos. When the song is played, it will create a devastating effect; the power of the Dirge of Chaos, combined with Johnny Sonata's demonic-granted voice, will spread enough negative and chaotic energy to devastate anyone who isn't prepared for it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL6_7_Issue4_Villain_Arc 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3748649974" "Aurora's Report"
// tDetailString :
"P327481851" "You were sent this official report that was made by Aurora Borealis regarding the incident with you, Malaise, Johnny Sonata, and Sister Psyche. Darrin Wade left his elaborate signature on a piece of paper on the report, indicating that he somehow obtained this for you to see. At the top of his note are the words...<br><br><b>Masterpiece</b><br><br>The report by Aurora Borealis begins by saying how she believes you forced Johnny Sonata to record the song on the artifact known as the Dirge of Chaos. Mynx and Swan of the Vindicators went to investigate the connection between you and Johnny Sonata after you attacked the safe house that Malaise was being kept in.<br><br>Aurora goes into great detail about the battle you had within Psyche's mind, putting full blame on you and Malaise for doing a great deal of damage to Sister Psyche. She mentions how you fought off every wave of psychic defenders that she and Sister Psyche created and warns that you're much more powerful than they had previously thought.<br><br>The report ends with details about what Swan and Mynx discovered in the Golden Giza, which is that Darrin Wade is your partner in this whole plan. Aurora suggests that Longbow and any able-bodied hero should stop at nothing to apprehend you and Wade, as you've both proven yourselves to be extremely dangerous. You have a feeling that Wade has some sort of plan in his mind for all of this, and you're prepared for your friendly working relationship with Wade to reach a possible sour ending; not many partnerships in the Isles tend to end with both sides getting what they want, and you'll be sure that <i>you</i> get what <i>you</i> want at the end of all this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Sheldon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1643751005" "Now, I gotta ask, what's the big deal with you tearin' through my boys? You must have some sorta death wish."
// Answer Text :
"P592273873" "I need you to sing a new song into this cassette player."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P969619277" "<color yellow>Johnny's eyes narrow, looking at the player.</color><br><br>Kid, I might not be the youngest cat around, but <i>that</i> thing is ancient history.<br><br>What makes you think I'm gonna sing you some song? Normally you gotta pay a <i>lot</i> of money for that privilege."
// Page InformationPage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P2061305985" "What makes you think I'm gonna sing you some song? Normally you gotta pay a <i>lot</i> of money for that privilege."
// Answer Text :
"P2253720809" "(Explain to Johnny the proposal for an artifact from Wade.)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2984224884" "Darrin Wade, huh? I've heard of the guy, little bit on the weird side, but whatever.<br><br>Maybe I'll do it for the artifact, but then kid, I'm gonna have every guy who thinks he's tough kicking down my door to get a song.<br><br>It's gonna take more than that to get me to help you."
// Page InformationPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P3502268539" "Maybe I'll do it for the artifact, but then kid, I'm gonna have every guy who thinks he's tough kicking down my door to get a song."
// Answer Text :
"P724505999" "(Rough up Johnny Sonata to show him a thing or two)"
// Answer Text :
"P59516707" "It would be a shame, Johnny, if someone destroyed the protections against those Wailers..."
// Page RoughUp Text :
"P2560472561" "<color orange>You use your abilities to rough up Johnny Sonata until he understands the benefits of working together with you.</color><br><br>Alright! Alright, kid, you made your point! I'll be upstairs getting ready."
// Page RoughUp SayOutLoudText :
"P2657356193" "Alright! Alright, kid, you made your point! I'll be upstairs getting ready."
// Answer Text :
"P3904324926" "Glad to see we're on the same page."
// Page TalkIt Text :
"P3077022498" "<color orange>Johnny's wrinkled face goes pale at your threat. He clears his throat.</color><br><br>Well, kid, maybe this whole offer of yours is worth it.<br><br>I'll be upstairs getting ready for our recording session. You better come prepared, you understand?"
// Page TalkIt SayOutLoudText :
"P264448951" "I'll be upstairs getting ready for our recording session. You better come prepared, you understand?"
// Answer Text :
"P3757590158" "Oh, I understand well enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
// SendOffString :
"P2173279431" "<color orange>Tyrka hands you a letter and a package.</color><br><br>I implore you to read over the letter and go over the contents of the package.<br><br>...<br><br>Are you prepared? I may have all the time in the world, given my current spiritual situation, but you do not. As you see, you've been given the Dirge of Chaos. Now, as you may or may not be aware, one of Sister Psyche's major weakness is negative emotions, or rather, a very <i>large</i> amount of negative emotions. It nearly crippled her back in the 1980's. The Dirge of Chaos is one such artifact that can do the same.<br><br>We will need a powerful song within the Dirge, and not just any song; we will need a song performed by one who is powered by demons. Luckily for us, there is such a man here in St. Martial: <color yellow>Johnny Sonata</color>, the man who sold his soul for his 'golden pipes'.<br><br>You have all the tools, {HeroName}. It will be up to you to get Johnny Sonata to record a song on the Dirge of Chaos. His Family goons won't try to attack you unless you go into the private areas of the Giza, then you will be fair game. You can let Johnny know that Darrin Wade will compensate him with a powerful artifact in return; I'd ask <i>you</i> to give him an artifact, but Wade insisted that you not pay any sort of price for this, given the legwork you'll be doing."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2266091809" "Record a Song on the Dirge of Chaos"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P757221504" "Johnny Sonata won't be expecting you, {HeroName}. That's always a good thing."
// TaskTitle :
"P1391944144" "<color deepskyblue>Masterpiece</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1213928805" "<color deepskyblue>Part I: The Golden Pipes</color>"

