// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Manticore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3178873250" "Defeat Manticore"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3386356870" "You've defeated Manticore!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4201099658" "The plan is finished! Sister Psyche will have to absorb the negative energy to stop all of this, leaving her in a weakened state."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3865856175" "Great work, {HeroName}. I've been keeping tabs on Malaise. Everything has gone according to plan.<br><br>He is inside of Sister Psyche's mind, causing all sorts of chaos and destruction. Well, he <i>would</i> be, if it weren't for that prat, <color yellow>Aurora Borealis</color>. She's trying to send in mental defenses to strengthen Sister Psyche's mind.<br><br>Malaise has two goals within Psyche's mind. The first is to release the personality of Aurora Borealis that is trapped in Psyche's mind; this will throw the psychic into chaos, and if all goes according to plan, allow the trapped woman to take <i>full</i> control over Psyche. The second is to then try and trap Sister Psyche within her own mind, allowing the 'fake' version of Aurora full rein."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Psyche 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P548231212" "<color orange>You see Sister Psyche curled up on the ground, staring out into the distance. Looking around the area, it seems like this is her memory of the first Rikti invasion.</color><br><br>Can't... can't do anymore... can't shut out the screaming... the pain... did everything I could to stop the Rikti... losing control... losing my mind... went too far... all alone now... all... all alone..."
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P1640540862" "Can't... can't do anymore... can't shut out the screaming... the pain... did everything I could to stop the Rikti... losing control... losing my mind... went too far... all alone now... all... all alone..."
// Answer Text :
"P3378813305" "That's right, Psyche.  You're all alone, no one is going to save you."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P260196153" "No... but I thought... the others... they'll come... Aurora, Positron, Manticore... Statesman..."
// Answer Text :
"P1147147137" "They're all dead. None of them can help you now."
// Answer Text :
"P1118948213" "They don't care about you. They'll never try to rescue you."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P214952522" "Dead! No... but... images of their deaths... flooding my mind...<br><br>Can't focus, too much negative emotions... how did they die?!"
// Page InformationPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P995707255" "Dead! No... but... images of their deaths... flooding my mind. Can't focus, too much negative emotions... how did they die?!"
// Answer Text :
"P3823624131" "Because you let them down, that's why."
// Page DontCare Text :
"P3625429301" "No... You're wrong! But...<br><br>It all makes sense. There's a new psychic... Aurora Borealis... maybe they didn't need me in the first place. They just needed a psychic... they didn't care about who it was... just that there was one... why go through all the effort to save me... when there's another waiting to be used?"
// Page DontCare SayOutLoudText :
"P4168830397" "It all makes sense. There's a new psychic... Aurora Borealis... maybe they didn't need me in the first place. They just needed a psychic... they didn't care about who it was... just that there was one... why go through all the effort to save me... when there's another waiting to be used?"
// Answer Text :
"P2737067489" "You're expendable, Psyche. You're nothing to them."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P86567058" "<color orange>You hear a noise in the distance. Aurora Borealis has arrived!</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PsycheAsylum 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P522520774" "Doctor...<br><br>I thought it was all real, all of it! The Freedom Phalanx... my husband, Manticore... {HeroName} and Malaise...<br><br><color orange>You'll have to convince Sister Psyche that her reality as a hero is fake. The best way to do that is to have her logically come to the conclusion that she was making everything up in her mind!"
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P2043187990" "I thought it was all real, all of it! The Freedom Phalanx... my husband, Manticore... {HeroName} and Malaise..."
// Answer Text :
"P3267590897" "The Freedom Phalanx. Let's talk about that."
// Answer Text :
"P1183787211" "Dr. Sinclair being your husband. Let's go deeper into that subject."
// Answer Text :
"P1978141219" "Tell me about {HeroName} and Malaise."
// Page MainDoubt Text :
"P2825022826" "I don't understand... I thought it was all real..."
// Page PsycheFree Text :
"P382536433" "I could've sworn that it was all real..."
// Page Wrong Text :
"P662932290" "No... I KNOW they were real!"
// Answer Text :
"P3552614070" "Please, Ms. Tilman, calm down. Let's start again."
// Page Doubt1 Text :
"P3921929999" "I remember them all, doctor. We fought together, we saved so many lives! We met back in the 1980's, Positron helped re-form the group after it had been previously disbanded.<br><br>It was all so real, you have to understand!"
// Page Doubt1 SayOutLoudText :
"P349168233" "I remember them all, doctor. We fought together, we saved so many lives! We met back in the 1980's, Positron helped re-form the group after it had been previously disbanded."
// Answer Text :
"P1219265532" "Ms. Tilman, the 1980's was when you were first checked in."
// Answer Text :
"P1468844297" "It wasn't real. Get over it."
// Page Doubt1B Text :
"P277441982" "No...! I was never checked in...<br><br>But, why? Why am I thinking about the asylum now? My father bringing me in... telling me it would all be OK. No... did I really... make all of that up... to escape this place?"
// Page Doubt1B SayOutLoudText :
"P1155410992" "Why am I thinking about the asylum now? My father bringing me in... telling me it would all be OK. No... did I really... make all of that up... to escape this place?"
// Answer Text :
"P1488610550" "You did, Ms. Tilman. But don't worry, we'll get through this."
// Page Doubt2 Text :
"P3139434093" "I swear, I was married to him! He isn't a doctor, he's a hero, a vigilante! Someone who gets things done, no matter the cost.<br><br>You're all just making this up, this is an illusion! This can't be real!"
// Page Doubt2 SayOutLoudText :
"P1712041613" "I swear, I was married to him! He isn't a doctor, he's a hero, a vigilante! Someone who gets things done, no matter the cost."
// Answer Text :
"P928099123" "Dr. Sinclair is your main caretaker. He always argues with the doctors about you."
// Answer Text :
"P3244756133" "You're just a girl having random dreams, Ms. Tilman."
// Page Doubt2B Text :
"P2223967854" "Arguing...<br><br>Is that why he was always having arguments with the others? Statesman and Manticore always getting in each other's way...<br><br>Was that all just from watching Dr. Sinclair argue with the others?"
// Page Doubt2B SayOutLoudText :
"P2951766043" "Was that all just from watching Dr. Sinclair argue with the others?"
// Answer Text :
"P740856512" "Yes, Ms. Tilman. Very good, we're making excellent progress."
// Page Doubt3 Text :
"P3442300588" "I think of {HeroName} and Malaise and I get <i>very</i> angry. I know they're both behind all of this! Malaise is trying to destroy my mind with his nightmares! {HeroName}... I don't know what motive {Hero.gender=male he|she} could have, but I KNOW they're behind this!<br><br>They want to destroy me, doctor, because of how powerful I am!"
// Page Doubt3 SayOutLoudText :
"P1222749671" "I KNOW that {HeroName} and Malaise are trying to destroy me because of my power!"
// Answer Text :
"P1499948495" "They are both figments of your imagination, made to boost yourself up, Ms. Tilman."
// Answer Text :
"P83136260" "Do you see, Ms. Tilman, how ridiculous you sound?"
// Page Doubt3B Text :
"P3344305806" "Boost myself... but they ARE real! They're trying to destroy me because I'm...<br><br>Because... I'm... powerful...<br><br>No, but it was real, it was all real!"
// Page Doubt3B SayOutLoudText :
"P792735178" "Boost myself... but they ARE real! They're trying to destroy me because I'm..."
// Answer Text :
"P2688273926" "Keep calm, Ms. Tilman. You're almost through this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrSinclair 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P55550203" "<color orange>Doctor Sinclair grins knowingly at you.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1959775262" "(Nod)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrKeyes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3072288681" "<color orange>Doctor Keyes grins knowingly at you.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrArcanus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2454827656" "<color orange>Doctor Arcanus grins knowingly at you.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Gossamer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3975165490" "<color orange>Fortunata Gossamer speaks to you in a neutral tone.</color><br><br>{HeroName}. I can send you inside of Sister Psyche's mind, when you are prepared.<br><br>Please let me know when you are ready."
// Answer Text :
"P164722086" "I'm ready, let's go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4191193148" "Now, there's one main issue we have right now, {HeroName}. Malaise is outnumbered in Sister Psyche's mind. He barely has the Aurora trapped within Psyche... hrm, for short-hand, let's just call her <color yellow>Aurora-Psyche</color>, shall we? Yes, he barely has Aurora-Psyche free, but now he has to contend with what remains of Psyche's defenses <i>and</i> the real Aurora Borealis."
// AcceptString :
"P301897301" "So I need to get into Psyche's mind to finish this. I assume you have a way in."
// SendOffString :
"P3641183287" "I do, {HeroName}. Do you remember <color yellow>Fortunata Gossamer</color>? Well, she's quite a powerful psychic in her own way. I've used some of my magics to take control of her in order to use her abilities to scan Malaise's progress. The girl was <i>quite</i> angry about how everything turned out in Warburg; she really left me no choice.<br><br>Gossamer can send a projection of yourself into Sister Psyche's mind. Once you're inside, you'll need to assist Malaise in dismantling Sister Psyche's defenses. Be careful in there, {HeroName}, you'll be fighting a cornered psychic and another powerful psychic, while also working together with a certifiable mad man."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2979728737" "Destroy Sister Psyche's Mind"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2251442184" "Malaise needs your help as soon as possible, {HeroName}!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3110903995" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Artistic Appreciation</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4207988218" "Gossamer flings a projection of yourself past Sister Psyche's destroyed defenses. You land in the heart of her mind, where Malaise awaits your aid."

