"P1719190134" "<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Bye bye, real Aurora! It was lovely having you for the bit of time you were here.<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Do you feel alone, Shalice? Aurora is gone, and now, it's just you, me, {HeroName}, and the woman you've had trapped in here.<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>And I know EXACTLY what your TRUE-"

