// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P24249411" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Ah, {HeroName}, you're right on time! The full cast has assembled!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P573746465" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>What a colorful cast we have here! {HeroName}, have you met the Aurora trapped in Psyche's mind yet?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P588445685" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Ah, trying to change the will of our protagonist! But alas, it is for nothing!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1109259844" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Isn't it obvious? I'm trying to free this little woman that you've wrongly TRAPPED in your mind!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4091265670" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>The trapped Aurora and I will work on de-stabilizing Psyche's little mind. {HeroName}, you'll have to do the work of weakening her guardians!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4066375752" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Now, Aurora! Exert your control over Psyche!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3056787006" "Yes! I knew I would still have my moment of glory!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P72955470" "I will be immortaaaAAAAAAAAAAAGGGHHH!!"
// SaysList :
"P3572646926" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Excellent work, {HeroName}! Let's move forward!"

