// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P267595965" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>I swear, Malaise, I'm going to rip you into pieces when this is over!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2376121083" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>What are you up to, Malaise?! What's the point of all this?!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1697143287" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>MALAISE! I WILL NOT LET YOU GET AWAY WITH THIS!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2508460773" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I tried to help you..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3666000662" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I stood up for you..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P468453284" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I put myself on the LINE for you!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2929837056" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>NO MORE! You end HERE, Malaise! HERE AND NOW!"

