// SaysList :
"P1211613375" "<em no t=2 d=5><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Why did you bother to marry me then, if you don't' want children?<t=8 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Please, you have to come to your senses. Dr. Sinclair is just trying to...<em disagree t=10 d=5><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>And the hours, -days- away? I can read your mind, Justin, even if you don't want me to!<em frustrated t=10 d=5><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Who are you kidding? With the way that -Swan- dresses?!<t=5 d=5><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>I should've known, marrying a billionaire playboy. You could never change, could you?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>ENOUGH! MALAISE! Stop this!<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Haha... THIS is one of your deepest fears? A husband that is disloyal? Or is it fear that you'll never have a child?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I swear, Malaise, I will have NO mercy on you when this is over!<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>And YOU, {HeroName}, YOU have chosen your fate. I will make sure YOU suffer greatly for all of this!"

