"P1298010735" "<em thanks t=5 d=5><t=10 d=10>Listen, Shalice. It's not that. It's just, it isn't the right time. We're both heroes...<em no t=10 d=5>I don't think of them in that way!<t=10 d=5>Shalice... you're right. There've... been a few, on the side. I've been meaning to tell you..."

