// Variable - NPC_DIALOG_MODEL 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NPC_AI_INACTIVE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NPC_AI_ACTIVE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P368826790" "<t=5 d=5><t=25 d=5>What... what happened? Where am I? {HeroName}, you're to blame for all of this!<t=25 d=5>No... But it was real! I remember all of it, I FELT all of it...!<t=5 d=5>I... I could've sworn..."
// SaysList :
"P270023992" "<t=10 d=5>I thought... it was all real... how could it not be real...?<t=10 d=5>Memories... experiences... no... NO! I KNOW what was real! I KNOW it!<t=5 d=5>I know what's real because I experienced it, because I REMEMBER my experience!<t=2 d=5>I remember my husband...<t=2 d=5>I remember my friends...<t=2 d=5>And I remember {HeroName}!<t=5 d=5>Now, GET OUT OF MY HEAD!"

