// SaysList :
"P2703721011" "<t=15 d=5><t=35 d=5>You had another one of your episodes, Ms. Tilman.<t=5 d=5>{Hero.gender=male Dr. Daniels|Dr. Orosco}, please speak with Ms. Tilman, help her get back into reality."
// SaysList :
"P642251790" "<t=15 d=5><t=2 d=5>Please, Ms. Tilman, you're delusional, you don't know what's real anymore. <t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Bah! Unbelievable! Those words triggered her memories?!"

