// SaysList :
"P1482907519" "<t=20 d=5>You gave us quite a scare there, Ms. Tilman.<t=15 d=5>The same as before, where you believe you are the world's most powerful psychic.<t=10 d=5>You regressed after the death of your mother, Ms. Tilman. You were trying to forget it all.<t=5 d=5>A reality that held an evil version of yourself, 'Mother Mayhem'. I feel we need to go deeper into that."
// SaysList :
"P966167468" "<t=5 d=5><t=5 d=5>It's fine, Ms. Tilman. The mind is a powerful thing, memories... they can play tricks on you. Even your own experiences."

