// Dialog :
"P2497016328" "You were able to destabilize Sister Psyche's mind and release the fake Aurora Borealis that was trapped within!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2787536532" "How does it feel, {HeroName}? You are responsible for destabilizing one of the world's most powerful psychics. Normally, you would have to watch out for Sister Psyche trying to get into your mind, but from my reports, she's quite busy trying to keep her own mind clear from Aurora.<br><br>It's a shame about Malaise, but in the end, he was just a means to an end, wasn't he? Malaise died willingly and happily, at the very least.<br><br>Now, the Freedom Phalanx is in complete chaos; Statesman is missing, Sister Psyche has gone insane, and Manticore is wrapped up in trying to cure Psyche's condition, rather than go after us. A good way to end the day, I do believe, though there is still much to be done. We'll be in touch, but I would prepare, {HeroName}. Your greatest challenge will soon be coming up, I guarantee it."
// RandomFameString :
"P1324147542" "I heard Sister Psyche is having a lot of problems. Should she still be fighting crime?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
